{"font_size": 0.4, "font_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_alpha": 0.5, "background_color": "#9C27B0", "Stroke": "none", "type": "AIsubtitle", "lang": "zh", "version": "v1.7.0.4", "body": [{"from": 2.94, "to": 3.62, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "OK哈喽大家好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 3.62, "to": 4.32, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "我是cl", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 4.32, "to": 8.07, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "那么在我入坑这个游戏的时候呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 8.07, "to": 10.53, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "因为我的那个桌子非常的高啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 10.53, "to": 15.9, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "所以导致我的这个沃兹我的发力方式比较扭曲", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 15.9, "to": 19.75, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "所以它会造成一个我的Y轴瞄准很艰难", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 19.75, "to": 23.13, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "就比如说我想往下微调或者是往下压枪什么的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 23.13, "to": 26.689, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "我就感觉我的手臂像粘在桌子上一样动不了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 27.089, "to": 30.4, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "那么然后一开始我也没管这个事情", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 30.4, "to": 31.2, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "然后一直在打", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 31.2, "to": 31.72, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "一直在打", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 31.72, "to": 34.12, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "后来打到稍微高一点的段位之后呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 34.12, "to": 37.2, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "我就发现这自己这个压枪的下限太低了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 37.2, "to": 38.87, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "就是经常有时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 38.87, "to": 42.32, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "比如说因为我这个外手瞄准的问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 42.32, "to": 46.62, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "我打不死这种斜向的瞄准或者打压枪什么的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 46.62, "to": 47.12, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "压不好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 47.12, "to": 50.099, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "那我后面呃怎么解决的呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 50.099, "to": 54.0, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "首先我一开始是使用这个指令啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 54.0, "to": 56.1, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "就是你们打开控制台", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 56.1, "to": 58.42, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "然后输入这个M1", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 58.42, "to": 60.46, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "把这个改成别的数字", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 60.46, "to": 61.42, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "比如我改低一点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 61.42, "to": 65.65, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "他这个上下和左右的这个比例啊就会变大", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 65.65, "to": 67.01, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "然后你的上下就会变快", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 67.01, "to": 67.89, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "走就会变慢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 67.89, "to": 70.1, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "那我一开始是通过这种方法来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 70.1, "to": 72.26, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "增加我这个Y轴的灵敏度啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 72.26, "to": 74.06, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "因为我的Y轴比较难移动嘛", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 74.06, "to": 77.79, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "所以我调灵敏度高一点也不会出现什么情况", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 77.79, "to": 78.91, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "适应了就行", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 78.91, "to": 81.45, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "那么后来呢威慑他自己出了一个新功能", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 81.45, "to": 82.4, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "叫什么呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 82.4, "to": 85.48, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "呃就是一个Y轴的一个灵敏度增强", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 85.48, "to": 87.32, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "那我们打还是打开控制台", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 87.32, "to": 88.82, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "输入这个SEN", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 88.82, "to": 91.71, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "按两下tab找到这个啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 91.71, "to": 94.85, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "带Y的这个就是就是个参数", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 94.85, "to": 97.55, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "那它默认的是1.0整啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 97.55, "to": 98.39, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "看我1.0的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 98.39, "to": 101.83, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "你看我这压枪就会很吃力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 101.83, "to": 103.64, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "我就会容易压飞啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 103.64, "to": 107.36, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "我现在经过我实战了很久很久", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 107.36, "to": 110.02, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "我现在把它调成1.3整这个数字", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 110.02, "to": 113.27, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "但我现在觉得他是比较接近", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 113.27, "to": 114.79, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "16比九的一个手感", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 114.79, "to": 119.45, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "而且啊他也不会说是控不住", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 119.45, "to": 122.59, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "我说是太滑太快", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 122.83, "to": 124.59, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "因为我平时在练枪软件里面", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 124.59, "to": 127.05, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "用的是16比九进行练枪的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 127.05, "to": 131.09, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "他这个手感也很像那个练枪软件的手感", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 131.09, "to": 133.92, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "那么最科学的呃", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 133.92, "to": 136.14, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "16比九转四比三的一个比例", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 136.14, "to": 138.8, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "应该是1.3333啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 138.8, "to": 140.56, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "但是我觉得这个灵敏度有点太滑了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 140.56, "to": 141.4, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "所以我把它降低了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 141.4, "to": 144.65, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "我现在1.30个人用起来是非常舒服的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 144.65, "to": 146.77, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "不管是压枪也好啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 146.77, "to": 148.6, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "定位也好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 151.06, "to": 153.94, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "感觉都是很合适", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 153.94, "to": 156.02, "sid": 61, "location": 2, "content": "那么这就这一个设置啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 156.02, "to": 159.61, "sid": 62, "location": 2, "content": "就瞬间让我的这个天梯实战的一个稳定性", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 159.61, "to": 160.65, "sid": 63, "location": 2, "content": "大大提高了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 160.65, "to": 162.68, "sid": 64, "location": 2, "content": "我现在基本上打天梯", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 162.68, "to": 164.58, "sid": 65, "location": 2, "content": "不会出现这种枪压不下来的情况", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 164.58, "to": 166.72, "sid": 66, "location": 2, "content": "以前经常就是见到人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 166.72, "to": 169.63, "sid": 67, "location": 2, "content": "然后瞄高了之后枪压不下来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 169.99, "to": 174.38, "sid": 68, "location": 2, "content": "那么这就是我本期要分享的一个两个设置啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 174.38, "to": 176.46, "sid": 69, "location": 2, "content": "第一个设置是这个M开头的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 176.46, "to": 179.43, "sid": 70, "location": 2, "content": "这个设置是以前的一个老参数", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 179.43, "to": 180.67, "sid": 71, "location": 2, "content": "你现在要用的话呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 180.67, "to": 182.61, "sid": 72, "location": 2, "content": "你可以把它调成0.0165", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 182.61, "to": 186.73, "sid": 73, "location": 2, "content": "这是16比九转四比三那个灵敏度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 187.01, "to": 190.17, "sid": 74, "location": 2, "content": "但是调完之后你一定要记得提高你的灵敏度啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 190.17, "to": 193.13, "sid": 75, "location": 2, "content": "因为它调完之后会使你的左右瞄准变慢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 193.13, "to": 195.12, "sid": 76, "location": 2, "content": "所以你得把你的灵敏度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 195.12, "to": 196.7, "sid": 77, "location": 2, "content": "比如说我调成1.5", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 196.7, "to": 200.019, "sid": 78, "location": 2, "content": "然后我再去更改另外一个设置", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 200.019, "to": 201.579, "sid": 79, "location": 2, "content": "就是也是我喜欢用的一个设置", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 201.579, "to": 204.9, "sid": 80, "location": 2, "content": "就是这个SEN按两下tab出来这个WESCALE", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 204.9, "to": 207.1, "sid": 81, "location": 2, "content": "你把它调成一个稍微大一点的数字", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 207.1, "to": 208.64, "sid": 82, "location": 2, "content": "比如说你看我现在调成二的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 208.64, "to": 211.12, "sid": 83, "location": 2, "content": "我上下就会变得啊过于灵敏", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 211.12, "to": 213.71, "sid": 84, "location": 2, "content": "那我就自己就容易控不住了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 213.71, "to": 216.11, "sid": 85, "location": 2, "content": "那所以我一般调1.3", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 217.82, "to": 220.24, "sid": 86, "location": 2, "content": "那仅仅是调的还不够", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 220.24, "to": 225.16, "sid": 87, "location": 2, "content": "因为它会改变你的这个瞄准了一个习惯啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 225.16, "to": 226.74, "sid": 88, "location": 2, "content": "因为比如说你看我调高了之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 226.74, "to": 227.84, "sid": 89, "location": 2, "content": "我像这样斜着瞄", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 227.84, "to": 229.62, "sid": 90, "location": 2, "content": "那我的Y轴变高了之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 229.62, "to": 232.7, "sid": 91, "location": 2, "content": "是不是我斜着这个走的距离要变短", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 233.82, "to": 236.34, "sid": 92, "location": 2, "content": "有准星的移动方式也要发生改变", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 236.34, "to": 238.82, "sid": 93, "location": 2, "content": "那么总结来就是一个字先调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 238.82, "to": 240.75, "sid": 94, "location": 2, "content": "然后再试一对", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 240.75, "to": 243.05, "sid": 95, "location": 2, "content": "很多人如果有跟我一样烦恼", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 243.05, "to": 244.25, "sid": 96, "location": 2, "content": "觉得自己枪压不下来的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 244.25, "to": 246.17, "sid": 97, "location": 2, "content": "可以试试我说的这个灵敏度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 246.17, "to": 248.43, "sid": 98, "location": 2, "content": "然后你多多加尝试", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 248.43, "to": 249.29, "sid": 99, "location": 2, "content": "多打死斗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 249.29, "to": 250.05, "sid": 100, "location": 2, "content": "多练习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 250.05, "to": 251.13, "sid": 101, "location": 2, "content": "然后你成功了之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 251.13, "to": 252.33, "sid": 102, "location": 2, "content": "你就大功告成了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 252.33, "to": 254.03, "sid": 103, "location": 2, "content": "现在就可以压中啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 254.03, "to": 255.635, "sid": 104, "location": 2, "content": "远距离的枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 259.96, "to": 262.4, "sid": 105, "location": 2, "content": "就第一把弹道压力比较直", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 264.54, "to": 266.34, "sid": 106, "location": 2, "content": "不会出现特别大程度的马枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 266.34, "to": 268.08, "sid": 107, "location": 2, "content": "那么本期视频到此结束", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 268.08, "to": 269.02, "sid": 108, "location": 2, "content": "喜欢这个视频", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 269.02, "to": 269.7, "sid": 109, "location": 2, "content": "不妨点个关注", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 269.7, "to": 270.74, "sid": 110, "location": 2, "content": "我们下期视频再见", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 270.74, "to": 271.52, "sid": 111, "location": 2, "content": "拜拜", "music": 0.0}], "bvid": "BV11yBpBNE6j", "title": "cs2 y轴瞄准艰难？压枪压不下来？一个设置教你解决一切烦恼", "owner": "Acool_ovo", "duration": 273}